721
00:48:20.314 --> 00:48:23.314
I repeat.

722
00:48:23.314 --> 00:48:28.314
Suppose that unbelievers come into a gathering of the congregation.

723
00:48:28.314 --> 00:48:32.314
If they hear everyone speaking only in tongues of the Spirit,

724
00:48:32.314 --> 00:48:35.314
they will think that you are crazy.

725
00:48:35.314 --> 00:48:38.314
