740
00:49:25.314 --> 00:49:27.314
For the edification of the congregation.

741
00:49:27.314 --> 00:49:28.314
You then make intercessions.

742
00:49:28.314 --> 00:49:32.314
For I don't know what, because it is the language I do not know.

743
00:49:32.314 --> 00:49:35.314
But if you do not know the interpretation there,

744
00:49:35.314 --> 00:49:39.314
