759
00:50:23.314 --> 00:50:24.314
Isn't that nice?

760
00:50:24.314 --> 00:50:27.314
Then they are just foolish.

761
00:50:27.314 --> 00:50:34.314
And I really see among people who mock the gifts of the Holy Spirit,

762
00:50:34.314 --> 00:50:38.314
